Jonathan Ai browser control is adapted from Octop's browser tool. It drives
a real Chrome or Chromium process over the Chrome DevTools Protocol and
keeps a user-data directory so logins persist across sessions. Jonathan Ai
does not vendor the upstream session, recorder, or installer. Every browser
action goes through the existing approval gate. A form submit, a purchase,
and a login each need their own approval, and a session-wide grant does not
skip them. Screenshot text is redacted in the page before capture, and
secrets are masked in the tool output and logs. Browser archives are
downloaded only from Chrome for Testing or the official Playwright CDN.
npmmirror is refused. The optional install extra is browser
(pip install "clawd-codex[browser]").

